    "text": "These former Greater Yuba area high school athletes are set to compete on Saturday, Nov. 15.\nAuckland Asiata\nFresno State Bulldogs\nDefensive lineman\nSophomore\n6′2″ 285\nSutter High School\nHometown: Yuba City\nNext Game: vs. Wyoming Cowboys, Saturday, Nov. 15, 12 a.m.\nBruno Anywanu\nSimpson Red Hawks\nJunior\n6′0″ 200\nYuba College\nHometown: Sacramento\nNext Game: vs. Arizona Christian Firestorm, Saturday, Nov. 15, 1 p.m.\nGarrett McCray\nSouthern Oregon Raiders\nJunior\n6′3″ 230\nEast Nicolaus High School\nHometown: Plumas Lake\nNext Game: vs. Idaho Yotes, Saturday, Nov. 15, 1 p.m.\nLandon Cooper\nEastern Washington Eagles\nSenior\n6′3″ 235\nSutter High School\nHometown: Sutter\nNext Game: vs. Northern Colorado Bears, Saturday, Nov. 15, 1 p.m.\nRyan Travis\nEastern New Mexico Greyhounds\nPunter\nSenior\n5′10″ 197\nPierce High School\nHometown: Arbuckle\nNext Game: vs. Texas A&M Kingsville Javelinas, Saturday, Nov. 15, 1 p.m.",
